      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- sender / recipient, handoff ID, schema version\n- task contract: goal, inputs, expected output\n- context and decisions\n- artifact references (by reference + hash, never copied)\n- permissions: allowed tools, scopes, approvals needed\n- provenance\n- execution state: step, attempt count, checkpoint\n- acceptance criteria",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- sender / recipient, handoff ID, schema version\n- task contract: goal, inputs, expected output\n- context and decisions\n- artifact references (by reference + hash, never copied)\n- permissions: allowed tools, scopes, approvals needed\n- provenance\n- execution state: step, attempt count, checkpoint\n- acceptance criteria",
